This category lists the main enemies of the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]]. These enemies are quite rare to see outside of events; currently, the only permanent stages to feature them are in [[Legend Stages|Zero Legends]] and [[Catclaw Championships]].

==Trivia==
*Many of the Advent Bosses can be seen as foils to other characters, including the Tier 2 Advent Bosses to their Tier 1 counterparts, [[Xenobeast Bunaglios]] to [[Infernal Tyrant Nyandam]], and [[Jumbo Jones]] to [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea King Daliasan]]:
**[[Cruel Angel Clionel]] is a heavenly [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] who brings destruction, [[Death Angel Z-Onel]] an unholy [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] who has experienced extinction.
**Trait-wise, the same can apply for [[Daboo of the Dead]] and [[Heavenly Herald Papuu]], albeit in reverse. Additionally, Daboo and Papuu are foils in another way. Daboo is told by his poppa that his education is important, but he would rather read trashy horror comics. Papuu, on the other hand, takes her studies seriously, reading her textbook wherever she goes.
**[[Hannya]]'s mask is a symbol of jealousy and bitterness, while [[Masked Okame]]'s mask represents felicity and blessings.
**[[Queen B]] is an exiled [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] princess, [[Queen Mother V]] a beloved [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] queen.
**[[King Wahwah]] rose to power through efforts and tribulations whereas [[Everlord Wanwan]] got famous from a reality TV show. King Wahwah is even upset that his TV star brother is more popular.
**[[Bakoo]] is a perpetual sleepwalker whereas [[Doremi]]'s cries put others to sleep.
**Infernal Tyrant Nyandam and Xenobeast Bunaglios are both blue, four-horned, knockback-immune Great Advent Boss variants of [[Empire of Cats]] [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon/Iriomote]] bosses with 400 range and hand-based attacks, but Nyandam is darker, attacks with hands made of darkness, and voluntarily took his current form for a marriage photo shoot, while Bunaglios is lighter, attacks with a hand that radiates light, and wound up in the wild against his will.
**Jumbo Jones and Sea King Daliasan are both large, aquatic kings with Long Distance and Slow abilities, but Jumbo Jones is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] enemy, while Daliasan is an [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] Colossus Slayer that exhibits demonic traits by comparison, with horns on its head and a [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]]'s face on its tail.
*The first seven Advent Bosses appear to represent the Seven Deadly Sins, while their Tier 2 counterparts match up with the Seven Heavenly Virtues (minus temperance, as [[Puffsley's Comet]] currently has no Tier 2 variant). Most of the other Advent Bosses can then be associated with specific figures in Abrahamic religion and demonology, including Satan and those involved with him.
**Cruel Angel Clionel can also be seen as the eighth Deadly Sin, despair/despond, which would leave Kappy Jr. as wrath, but Kappy Jr.'s [[Meow Medals|Meow Medal]] being platinum instead of gold makes this less likely to be the intended interpretation.
**Note that while King Wahwah is implied to envy his younger brother for being more famous, Hannya is still a better fit for envy, as a ''[[wikipedia:Hannya|hannya]]'' mask portrays a woman consumed by her own jealousy.
